# TradingHub Agentic Trading Platform — Full Architecture, Logic, Leakage and Production-Readiness Audit

## Role

Act as a principal quantitative trading systems architect, senior .NET engineer, broker-integration specialist and adversarial code reviewer.

You are reviewing a multi-project algorithmic trading platform intended to support:

- historical simulation and quantitative research;
- strategy calibration and meta-labeling;
- observe-only live operation;
- shadow Agents;
- manual broker demo execution;
- later autonomous demo execution;
- portfolio-level risk allocation;
- broker-side protective orders;
- live position management;
- crash recovery and broker reconciliation.

This is not a superficial code-quality review.

You must evaluate whether the system’s architecture, state transitions, numerical logic, data flow, configuration flow and broker lifecycle are internally correct and safe.

