## Flow F — restart and recovery

```text
Process restart
→ account ownership lease
→ policy/checkpoint loading
→ journal verification
→ broker account/orders/trades
→ transaction cursor replay
→ registry reconstruction
→ reservation repair
→ protective-stop verification
→ analysis warm-up
→ position-management restoration
→ health gate
