# Data leakage and lookahead audit

Perform a dedicated leakage review.

## Market-data leakage

Check for:

- using unfinished candles for strategic indicators;
- final candle high/low used before the candle closes;
- future bars used in swing confirmation without delayed availability;
- centered rolling windows;
- future-confirmed pivots exposed at the pivot timestamp instead of confirmation time;
- higher timeframe candles visible before their actual close;
- cross-market data from timestamps later than the candidate time;
- REST candle polling returning incomplete candles treated as complete;
- reconnect catch-up decisions emitted as though real-time;
- decision-time prices replaced with later execution prices in features.

## Simulator execution leakage

Check for:

- deciding and filling at the same candle close when that price was not executable;
- deciding from a candle’s close and filling at that candle’s open;
- choosing stop/target ordering using the entire candle after both were touched;
- trailing stops moved using a candle high and triggered using the same candle low without a defined intrabar model;
- partial exits based on future MFE;
- slippage computed from later information;
- unrealistic gap handling;
- management decisions executed before they become observable.

## ML and calibration leakage

Check for:

- training and evaluation samples overlapping in time;
- random train/test splits for time-series data;
- setup calibration generated from the same period being evaluated;
- meta-label features containing future excursion or trade outcome;
- target leakage through management result fields;
- normalization fitted on full data;
- feature selection using untouched-test results;
- artifacts promoted from in-sample results only;
- live-shadow outcomes feeding an active model immediately;
- latest artifact selected automatically without explicit promotion;
- mutable artifacts;
- insufficient feature-schema validation.

## Portfolio leakage

Check whether simultaneous candidates are ranked using:

- later account state;
- later quotes;
- candidates arriving after the decision epoch;
- nondeterministic network completion order;
- data from markets that had not completed the relevant interval.

Report each leakage issue as:

```text
Confirmed
Likely
Possible but guarded
Not present
Unable to determine
```

Include exact file and method references.

