RolloverBlackoutMinutesAfter = 15

EconomicEventFilterEnabled = false
```

Verify these values across:

- domain-model defaults;
- API request defaults;
- Dashboard defaults;
- simulator presets;
- policy promotion;
- JSON serialization;
- live-policy loading;
- fallback constructors;
- unit tests;
- sample configuration;
- application settings;
- CLI paths.

Look for any path that can silently return to:

```text
