13. Which subsystem most needs extension?
14. Which subsystem should not be extended until more evidence exists?
15. What exact evidence is required before enabling autonomous mode?

Be critical and evidence-based.

Do not accept implementation claims without tracing the code.

Do not confuse interfaces, DTOs or tests with a wired production capability.

Do not change strategy behaviour merely to produce more trades.

Do not weaken risk controls to improve trade frequency.

Do not enable broker writes automatically.

Do not claim broker certification without running explicit Practice/Demo tests.

The final result must make it possible for another senior engineer to understand exactly what is safe, what is unsafe, what is missing and what should be implemented next.
